                <invention-title lang="fr">NACELLE POUR ÉOLIENNE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">A NACELLE FOR A WIND TURBINE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A wind turbine nacelle configured for mounting on a wind turbine tower and for supporting a rotor-supporting assembly, the nacelle comprising a main unit, and at least one auxiliary unit. The auxiliary unit accommodates a at least one component, e.g. a converter or transformer. To provide efficient transportation, lower costs and easier assembly, the operative component is suspended directly on the main unit.</p>
            </abstract>
